  "historyNote": "#2012, eff 5-5-82; ss by #2722, eff 5-23-84; ss by #4192, eff 12-23-86; ss by #5490, eff 10-19-92; amd by #6179, eff 1-30-96; ss by #6853, eff 9-23-98; ss by #8709, eff 8-25-06; ss by #10758, eff 1-16-15; ss by #14231, eff 4-3-25, EXPIRES 4-3-35",
